---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import Navbar from "../components/homepage/Navbar.astro";
import Footer from "../components/shared/Footer.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Refund Policy | Zephyr Translate"
  description="Refund Policy for Zephyr Translate — Windows desktop AI translation tool by zephyrdn.com. 14-day full refund on Pro subscriptions and Lifetime licenses."
>
  <Navbar />
  <main class="legal-page">
    <h1>Refund Policy</h1>
    <p class="legal-updated">Last updated: August 3, 2026</p>
    <p class="legal-lead">
      This Refund Policy applies to paid plans of <strong>Zephyr Translate</strong> —
      Pro subscriptions (monthly or yearly) and Lifetime licenses — sold through our payment
      provider, Paddle.
    </p>

    <h2>1. 14-Day Refund Guarantee</h2>
    <p>
      We offer a <strong>full refund within 14 days</strong> of your purchase if you are not
      satisfied with Zephyr Translate. This applies to both Pro subscriptions and Lifetime
      licenses, without requiring a reason.
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>Refund requests received within 14 days of purchase are eligible for a full refund of the amount paid.</li>
      <li>Refunds are issued
        <strong>in accordance with Paddle's refund rules and applicable law</strong>, including
        consumer protection regulations in your jurisdiction.
      </li>
      <li>After the 14-day window, refunds are considered on a case-by-case basis (for example, if
        the software fails to run on your device and we are unable to resolve the issue).</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>2. How to Request a Refund</h2>
    <p>
      Since payments are processed by Paddle, you can request a refund through either channel:
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Option 1 — Paddle Purchase History:</strong> Paddle provides a self-service
        purchase history and refund request flow at their customer portal (see your order receipt
        email from Paddle for the details).</li>
      <li><strong>Option 2 — Contact us:</strong> Email
        <a href="mailto:Yakovxia@gmail.com">Yakovxia@gmail.com</a> with your order reference or the
        email address used at checkout. We will guide you through the process.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>3. When Refunds Are Issued</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Refund requests are generally processed within 5–10 business days after approval, depending on your payment method and bank.</li>
      <li>The refund is issued to the original payment method used at checkout.</li>
      <li>Once a refund is issued, your license key will be deactivated and Pro/Lifetime features will no longer be available.</li>
      <li>Free plan usage is not subject to this policy (it is provided at no cost).</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>4. Subscription Cancellations</h2>
    <p>
      For Pro subscriptions, you may cancel at any time via Paddle — you will retain access to
      Pro features until the end of the current billing period. The 14-day refund guarantee covers
      the initial payment; renewals canceled within 14 days of the renewal charge are also covered
      by this policy.
    </p>

    <h2>5. Exceptions</h2>
    <p>
      Refunds may be refused or reduced in cases of suspected fraud, abuse of the refund policy,
      misuse of license keys, or where required by applicable law. We reserve the right to deny
      refunds in these circumstances.
    </p>

    <h2>6. Questions</h2>
    <p>
      If you have any questions about this Refund Policy, please contact us at
      <a href="mailto:Yakovxia@gmail.com">Yakovxia@gmail.com</a>.
    </p>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .legal-page { max-width: 720px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 5rem 1.5rem 4rem; color: var(--color-text-muted); line-height: 1.7; }
  .legal-lead { font-size: 1.1rem; color: var(--color-white); margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }
  .legal-page h1, .legal-page h2 { color: var(--color-white); margin: 1.5rem 0 0.75rem; }
  .legal-page h1 { margin-top: 0; }
  .legal-page a { color: var(--color-blue); }
  .legal-page ul { padding-left: 1.25rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
  .legal-updated { color: var(--color-text-faint); font-size: 0.85rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
  @media (max-width: 600px) { .legal-page { padding: 4rem 1rem 3rem; } }
</style>
